uncertain cases to scientific review.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-49f3d437\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Designed canonical-record and entity-resolution rules across drug, condition, protein, and clinical-trial sources, preserving source identifiers and provenance.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-902e8b89\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Built and maintained SQL, Python, and Ruby pipelines to map, validate, and load external reference datasets into PostgreSQL and Neo4j.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-87abdca3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Specified REST API payloads, schema mappings, validation rules, and backward-compatible releases for downstream customer integrations.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-0e09662d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Documented data definitions, lineage, and data-quality constraints in a catalog used by engineering and customer teams.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-dda626ca\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role_key\": \"national-formulary-cooperative\",\n      \"context\": {\n        \"text\": \"Led technical delivery for national drug-information products, connecting pharmacy practice, editorial policy, and software teams.\",\n        \"source_ids\": [\"ctx-61b15573\"]\n      },\n      \"bullets\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Managed roadmap proposals and publishing backlogs for drug-reference databases and APIs under an informatics title.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-2d93876a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Authored functional requirements, workflow specifications, validation rules, and acceptance criteria for publishing and customer-integration changes.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-44ea72a5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Designed dimensional data models and SQL transformations for drug classifications, terminology mappings, and product-quality reporting.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-ff30e97f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Presented product demonstrations and technical recommendations to clinical editors, customers, engineering teams, and organizational leadership.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-806e30cf\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role_key\": \"cascade-valley-health-system\",\n      \"context\": {\n        \"text\": \"Worked with pharmacists, interface engineers, and software vendors to translate clinical medication workflows into safe, testable system behavior.\",\n        \"source_ids\": [\"ctx-bedad38f\"]\n      },\n      \"bullets\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Defined and tested medication, pharmacy-interface, and clinical-decision-support requirements for hospital implementations.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-ceedc273\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Wrote SQL validation queries and reconciliation reports for clinical mappings, charge capture, and go-live readiness.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-ede6b9ec\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Supported clinical research teams with data definitions, de-identification requirements, and reproducible extraction logic.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"b-397a9050\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_options":{"mode":"explicit","ttl":"30m"},"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","description":null,"name":"ConstrainedResumeDraft","schema":{"$defs":{"ConstrainedLine":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"text":{"title":"Text","type":"string"},"source_ids":{"items":{"enum":["sum-5111c6d8","skl-46fab4b1","skl-41750107","skl-f5c43ff6","skl-03